          "_baseline_note_returns_raises": "AUTHORISED RE-RECORD (API-03): GET /api/stats no longer computes its figures from the per-user dashboard aggregator fed a sentinel public identity (which mostly returned that non-existent accounts empty state, published todays PnL under a key spelled total, and swallowed a failed read into a 200 of all zeros). It now calls backend_app.backend.platform_stats.get_platform_stats, a genuine service-role aggregation, and the handler raises a REAL 503 PLATFORM_STATS_UNAVAILABLE when a statement does not complete instead of returning a fabricated zero response. returns collapses to computed because the response is now built by a called function rather than a literal dict in this module; the real response shape is pinned by tests/test_api03_platform_stats_are_real.py. Regression: tests/test_api03_platform_stats_are_real.py.",
